## Images

Variants live in `.docker/variants/` (one base image each, with its driver floor). Pull requests build every variant without pushing. A release on `main` (conventional commits) pushes `{{ registry }}/{{ owner }}/{{ project_name }}:<version>-<variant>`. There is no `latest` tag.
